      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这比赛的名字倒是家喻户晓。\r\n是一场象征着长距离的无上荣誉的，\r\n古马级长距离GⅠ。不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9566ea56ef31dc9ee064418396be65f41c5c3e3e5e8d515f18f89a4e63b368f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
