      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我想不明白，这比赛与新宇宙有什么\r\n联系。\r\n为什么会是『天皇赏（春）』？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c3374a126c96ae39dea76600206d40854fdde1cd1dd8f208dc50d811513ec1e",
