    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7defcb2b37ce52c07069da8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，尚存的理智却阻止了我继续询问。\r\n我叩开了那扇冰冷的门扉，\r\n却只见到了更多谜团……",
      "source_fingerprint": "db79dc064775de83f36eb4b397e0e76ffe3e78feca1fee2844d84e92c1002986",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
