    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8558014b83bd60ca820247af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——遥远的目标。\r\n如果要现在就开始挑战3200米比赛的话，\r\n还是太早了。这样的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd4ad00a64810330a0cf84c477c1061be4dad4f8339fcfb5591d8cf28e074136",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
