    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f1a1baeff70e6fc73dceef1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠路线的初战，2000米。\r\n先从最普通的，所有人都能挑战的轨道开始，\r\n然后——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e30b3563e768e8ed0a8a6f679728fb1cf5a59adfb7aee51fbb3164d91c44a0ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
