    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa6c7ae13ee34e438f4023a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从秋季『菊花赏』的3000米开始，\r\n转换向『天皇赏（春）』的3200米轨道。\r\n这样的路线，倒也挺王道的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d160e6003ef346ce235c7d3a465c37b037a85dcc45dc58da35c8cf481e1d0e20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
