    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb08d9c80a64000d25f40b4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从明年的『皋月赏』开始，也许就能逐渐接触\r\n到新宇宙的真心了吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "49249c98fe189141a2c136259e654024c9941a66eeb57b7728fdf73abaa91315",
